# paper_v1 results directory — first re-run of §8 cells under the
# corrected paper-port stack (Steps 0–4 of port-to-paper-20260424).
#
# Cell JSONs land here. A run_manifest.json at the root will be generated
# by benchmarks/_manifest.py at the start of each run.
#
# Naming convention: <NN>_<bench>_<ctx>_<config>[.<machine>].json
# e.g. 01_pg19_4K_dense.json, 01_pg19_4K_certified.gpu0.json
#
# When two machines coexist, append a `.<machine_tag>` segment before
# `.json` so cell basenames stay unique in the merged tree.
